<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Oilers Extra Virgin Olive Oil | Sovereign Blood. First Press. Untouched.</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,600&family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --olive-dark: #112110;
            --navy-deep: #161A28;
            --gold: #D4AF37;
            --gold-light: #FCF6BA;
            --gold-dark: #997A15;
            --ochre: #C86446;
            --cream: #FDFBF7;
            --cream-muted: #EAE6DF;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--olive-dark);
            color: var(--cream);
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4, .serif-font {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(17, 33, 16, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 1.2rem 5%;
        }

        .nav-brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--cream);
        }

        .nav-logo-mark {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.05);
        }

        .nav-title {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 2.5rem;
            list-style: none;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--cream);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--gold);
        }

        .cta-btn-nav {
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            background: transparent;
        }

        .cta-btn-nav:hover {
            background: var(--gold);
            color: var(--olive-dark);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        header.hero {
            position: relative;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 8rem 2% 4rem;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(17, 33, 16, 0.85), rgba(17, 33, 16, 0.92));
            border: 15px solid transparent;
            border-image: linear-gradient(to bottom right, var(--gold), transparent, var(--gold)) 1;
            margin: 15px;
        }

        .hero-content {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold);
            padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
            font-weight: 500;
            color: var(--cream);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem);
            color: var(--cream-muted);
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        .hero-btns {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--gold);
            color: var(--olive-dark);
            padding: 0.9rem 2.2rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform 0.3s, background 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: var(--gold-light);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            color: var(--gold);
            padding: 0.9rem 2.2rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.1);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Twin Pillars Section */
        section.pillars {
            padding: 7rem 10%;
            background: var(--navy-deep);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
        }

        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 4rem;
        }

        .section-header h2 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .section-header p {
            color: var(--cream-muted);
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .pillars-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 3rem;
        }

        .pillar-card {
            background: rgba(17, 33, 16, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.25);
            padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
            position: relative;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .pillar-card:hover {
            border-color: var(--gold);
        }

        .pillar-tag {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: var(--ochre);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: block;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .pillar-card h3 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--cream);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .pillar-card p {
            color: var(--cream-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* Product Lineup Section */
        section.products {
            padding: 7rem 10%;
            background: var(--olive-dark);
        }

        .products-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
            margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        .product-card {
            background: rgba(22, 26, 40, 0.5);
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
            padding: 2.5rem 1.8rem;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        .product-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: var(--gold);
            background: rgba(22, 26, 40, 0.8);
        }

        .product-badge {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--gold);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .product-card h4 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: var(--cream);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .product-card p {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--cream-muted);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .product-link {
            color: var(--gold);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gold);
            padding-bottom: 2px;
        }

        /* Sacred Unboxing Section */
        section.unboxing {
            padding: 7rem 10%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--navy-deep), #0d101a);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.2);
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 4rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .unboxing-content h2 {
            font-size: 2.8rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .unboxing-content p {
            color: var(--cream-muted);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        .praise-box {
            background: rgba(17, 33, 16, 0.8);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);
            padding: 2rem;
            font-style: italic;
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--gold-light);
        }

        .bottle-preview-box {
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4);
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            position: relative;
        }

        .bottle-preview-box::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 10px; left: 10px; right: 10px; bottom: 10px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .bottle-title {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-size: 2rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: var(--gold);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .bottle-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--ochre);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .cert-seal {
            display: inline-block;
            border: 1px solid var(--gold);
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--gold);
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* Founder Quote Section */
        section.founder {
            padding: 6rem 10%;
            background: var(--olive-dark);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .founder-quote-container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .quote-icon {
            font-size: 4rem;
            color: var(--gold);
            line-height: 0.5;
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .founder-quote {
            font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem);
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--cream);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .founder-sig {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--gold);
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            background: #091208;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.3);
            padding: 4rem 10% 2rem;
        }

        .footer-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .footer-col h4 {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .footer-col p, .footer-col ul {
            color: var(--cream-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .footer-col ul li {
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        }

        .footer-col ul li a {
            color: var(--cream-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }

        .footer-col ul li a:hover {
            color: var(--gold);
        }

        .footer-bottom {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 2rem;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: rgba(253, 251, 247, 0.5);
        }

        .whisper-line {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .hero-content, .section-header {
            animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out;
        }

        @media(max-width: 768px) {
            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }
            header.hero {
                padding: 6rem 5% 3rem;
                margin: 5px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Navigation Bar -->
    <nav>
        <a href="#" class="nav-brand">
            <div class="nav-logo-mark">O</div>
            <span class="nav-title">OILERS</span>
        </a>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="#origin">The Origin</a></li>
            <li><a href="#range">Reserve Range</a></li>
            <li><a href="#heritage">Ancestral Soul</a></li>
            <li><a href="#certification">CTC Certified</a></li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="cta-btn-nav">Request Pitch Kit</a>
    </nav>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <header class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <span class="hero-badge">100% South African • SA Olive CTC Certified</span>
            <h1>Sovereign Blood. <span>First Press.</span> Untouched.</h1>
            <p>Born in the world-class terroir of the Western Cape, carrying the unbroken, sovereign spirit of the AmaXesibe ancestors from the mountains of the Eastern Cape.</p>
            <div class="hero-btns">
                <a href="#range" class="btn-primary">Explore Reserve Range</a>
                <a href="#origin" class="btn-secondary">Read Brand Manifesto</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Twin Pillars Section -->
    <section class="pillars" id="origin">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>The Convergence of Terroir & Ancestry</h2>
            <p>A fusion of modern agricultural excellence and an ancient bloodline that refused annexation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pillars-grid">
            <div class="pillar-card">
                <span class="pillar-tag">The Body • Western Cape</span>
                <h3>Agricultural Mastery</h3>
                <p>Sourced from the world-renowned, premium-growing regions of the Western Cape. Our extra virgin olive oil delivers exceptional fruitiness, rigorous acidity standards below 0.8%, and uncompromised SA Olive CTC certification[cite: 3].</p>
                <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gold);">Strategic vision toward estate acquisition in the Cape.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="pillar-card">
                <span class="pillar-tag">The Soul • Eastern Cape</span>
                <h3>Sovereign Heritage</h3>
                <p>Inspired by the AmaXesibe Clan, whose forefathers stood unyielding around Mount Ntsizwa and the Mtamvuna River. Extra Virgin Olive Oil is the first, purest pressing—untouched, independent, and sovereign by definition[cite: 3].</p>
                <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--gold);">Igazi lethu. Ukucindezela kokuqala.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Product Range Architecture -->
    <section class="products" id="range">
        <div class="section-header">
            <h2>Naming Architecture & Reserve Range</h2>
            <p>A scalable luxury collection honouring the lineage and geography of the AmaXesibe.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="products-grid">
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-badge">Core Collection</div>
                <h4>OILERS Classic</h4>
                <p>The signature blend from the fertile groves of the Western Cape (500ml / 750ml).</p>
                <a href="#" class="product-link">Inquire</a>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-badge">Flagship Reserve</div>
                <h4>Ntsizwa Reserve</h4>
                <p>Named after Mount Ntsizwa. Limited edition flagship harvest for global connoisseurs.</p>
                <a href="#" class="product-link">Inquire</a>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-badge">Estate Selection</div>
                <h4>Mtamvuna Press</h4>
                <p>Single-origin homage to the historic river where Xesibe leadership found legacy.</p>
                <a href="#" class="product-link">Inquire</a>
            </div>
            <div class="product-card">
                <div class="product-badge">Gifting & Corporate</div>
                <h4>Fikeni’s Gold</h4>
                <p>Named after Chief Fikeni, symbolizing enlightenment, education, and supreme prestige.</p>
                <a href="#" class="product-link">Inquire</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Sacred Unboxing Section -->
    <section class="unboxing" id="heritage">
        <div class="unboxing-content">
            <h2>The Sacred Reveal</h2>
            <p>Every bottle is housed in a matte black rigid box with gold foil embossing. Upon opening, the first sight is not just branding—it is lineage[cite: 3].</p>
            <div class="praise-box">
                "Nxanda kaXesibe, Mnune Mkhuma, Nondzaba, Mbathane, Nondize, Bhelesi..."
            </div>
            <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--cream-muted);">Printed in gold ink inside the lid. This is sacred. This is ours[cite: 3].</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bottle-preview-box">
            <div class="bottle-title">OILERS</div>
            <div class="bottle-subtitle">Extra Virgin Olive Oil</div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--cream-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Origin: Western Cape, South Africa<br>Acidity: &lt; 0.8% • Cold First Press</p>
            <div class="cert-seal">SA Olive CTC Certified</div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Founder Quote Section -->
    <section class="founder">
        <div class="founder-quote-container">
            <div class="quote-icon">“</div>
            <p class="founder-quote">We are not building an olive oil company. We are building a cultural institution that happens to sell olive oil[cite: 3].</p>
            <span class="founder-sig">The Founder & Custodian • Nxanda kaXesibe Lineage</span>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer id="contact">
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>OILERS EVOO</h4>
                <p>Bridging the world-class olive groves of the Western Cape with the ancient sovereign pride of the Eastern Cape.</p>
                <p class="whisper-line">Nxanda kaXesibe. Mnune Mkhuma. Nondzaba.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Global Export Markets</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#">Japan (Craft, Patience & Lineage)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">China (Sovereignty & Gold Standard)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">United Kingdom & EU (Traceability & Ethics)</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Venezuela (Resilience & Shared History)</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-col">
                <h4>Partnerships & Samples</h4>
                <p>For commercial distribution, global pitching, and private reserve allocation.</p>
                <p style="margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--gold);">concierge@oilers.co.za</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Oilers Extra Virgin Olive Oil. All Rights Reserved. Bottled with the pride of the AmaXesibe[cite: 3].</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
